:: Bailey Sell Kick
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

You walk for a long time, hooded, your wrists bound behind your back.
<br><br>

Bailey stops walking. You walk right into <<him>>. <<His>> hand closes around your arm to hold you still.
<br><br>

<<Hes>> quiet. You hear <<him>> breathe out through <<his>> nose.
<br><br>

Without warning, <<he>> kicks you in your ribs.<<pain 6>><<gpain>>
<br><br>

You fold around it. The hood twists against your face.
<br><br>

"Worthless," <<he>> says.<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

<<His>> shoe meets your shins. You hit the floor on your shoulder. The rope bites at your wrists. The hood is hot against your face, your own breath trapped inside it.
<br><br>

<<link [[Endure|Bailey Sell Kick Endure]]>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 600>>
<br>
<<link [[Beg|Bailey Sell Kick Beg]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4) and $masochism gte 300>>
	<<link [[Lick <<his>> shoe|Bailey Sell Kick Lick]]>><</link>><<promiscuous4>><<if !$settings.blindStatsEnabled>> | <span class="purple">Masochism</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Sell Kick Endure
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You're on your knees now. You try to endure Bailey's punishment.
<br><br>

A kick lands across your face.
<br><br>

<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	You take it. You don't make a sound.<<gwillpower>><<willpower 10>>
	<br><br>

	The toe of <<his>> boot nudges your shoulder. You stay still. Bailey exhales above you.<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You cry out.</span><<pain 4>><<gpain>><<gwillpower>><<willpower 3>>
	<br><br>

	"Shut up, you little shit," Bailey says. <<He>> kicks you across the face again in the same spot. "Do you have to be so noisy all the time?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> hauls you up by your bindings. Your body aches everywhere <<he>> kicked you.
<br><br>

<<He>> makes you walk forward.
<br><br>

<<link "Next" $bailey_kick_return>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Sell Kick Beg
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Please! S-Stop it!" you beg. "Why are you doing this?"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You raise one arm to protect yourself. "Bailey, please stop. Tell me what you want."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You curl around the pain and wait for the next kick. "Please... I'll do what you say."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You catch Bailey's ankle before <<he>> can kick again. "Stop. Explain what you're doing."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Stop it, Bailey!" you demand. "What's wrong with you?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You bare your teeth and shove <<his>> foot away. "Kick me again. See what I break first."
<<else>>
	"Stop!" you hiss out. "Why are you doing this?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

A swift kick lands across your face.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
<br><br>

"This is the least you deserve, brat." You can imagine the sneer on Bailey's face when <<he>> speaks. "Get up."
<br><br>

<<He>> hauls you up by your bindings. Your body aches everywhere <<he>> kicked you.
<br><br>

<<He>> makes you walk forward.
<br><br>

<<link "Next" $bailey_kick_return>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Sell Kick Lick
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<set $stockholm_points to ($stockholm_points || {})>>

You hear the scuff of Bailey's shoes in front of you.
<br><br>

The floor is cold and damp under your knees. You can't see. You reach blindly with your face across the floor until the hood shifts upwards and your cheek finds <<his>> shoe.
<br><br>

You press your tongue to it. You taste dirt and salt and leather.<<arousal 600>><<garousal>>
<br><br>

Bailey goes still. Your tongue moves clumsily over the surface of <<his>> shoe.
<br><br>

"Look at you." Bailey scoffs above you. "Pathetic."<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<He>> lifts <<his>> foot and presses the toe against your jaw, holding you there for a moment. The tunnels are filled with the sound of your breathing.
<br><br>

Eventually, Bailey pulls you up by your bindings. <<He>> walks slower than before.<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<if !$stockholm_points.kick>><<set $stockholm_bailey += 1>><<set $stockholm_points.kick to true>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<br><br>

You walk the rest of the way with the taste of <<his>> shoe still in your mouth.
<br><br>

<<link "Next" $bailey_kick_return>><</link>>
<br>
